aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.fallback=If you need the hall build, a house line, or a straight answer about guards, say it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.greeting.0=Hello. Need a guard, or just passing through?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.greeting.1=Lyren sends his regards when he remembers. What can I do for you?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.greeting.2=The hall is quiet until we finish building it. Then the roster fills at dawn.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_guild_hall=You said the town needs a proper guild hall.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_guild_hall_finish=The guild hall is finished. I am here to close the quest.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_guild_building=The guild hall is still going up. I wanted to ask where things stand.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_house=You wanted to talk about a house.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_house_finish=Your name is on the house shelf. I figured you should hear it from me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_house_remind=The house is still in progress.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.leave=That is all for now. I will see you later.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.body=Lyren asked me to keep an eye on the town, but adventurers need more than a borrowed corner at the inn. Stake a plot for a guild hall, pay the sign, and we can hire guards from a real roster each morning instead of hoping someone brave wanders past.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.accept=We will get the hall built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.decline=Not right now. I need a bit more time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_accepted.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_accepted.body=Good. Take the plot token, stake the hall, and feed the sign what it asks for. I will camp at the inn until the roof is honest, then meet me at the roster board so we can call it settled.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_accepted.ok=See you when the walls are up.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_building.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_building.body=The construction sign still lists materials we are short on. Either keep stacking timber and stone, or tell me straight if you want to shelve the project so I am not waiting on a hall that is not happening.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_building.ok=I am still working on it and I will keep going.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_done.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_done.body=There it is. Adventurers will sign on at dawn, and you can hire guards who know how to hold a line instead of guessing who is willing to stand watch.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_done.ok=Good to hear. I will check the roster at dawn.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.body=The hall is for work and guards. I still want a small home like everyone else. Same house plot as the rest of the town. Put my name on the shelf inside when the walls are real.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.accept=I will stake a house for you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.decline=Another time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_accepted.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_accepted.body=When the place is up, register me on the block inside, then come find me. I want to hear you say it out loud before I call it home.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_accepted.ok=You will hear it from me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_remind.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_remind.body=Take your time with the frame. When it is standing, put my name on the shelf inside, then come back. I am not rushing you. I just want it written down.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_remind.ok=Understood.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_finish.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_finish.body=There. A door that is mine at night. That is worth more than it looks when you have slept on inn boards for weeks.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_finish.ok=You earned it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.rep_reward_50.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.birthday.greeting=You remembered my birthday. The guild hall feels warmer already.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
